  "statuteText": "141-E:9 Control of Asbestos Emissions. –\n\nNo person, whether natural or not natural, owning, controlling or managing any workplace, public building, facility, school, or rental dwelling involved in asbestos abatement shall permit such abatement of asbestos in a dry state or in violation of any rules adopted by the commissioner under this chapter unless specifically exempted by rule."
